  "metadata": {
    "title": "SandyDuck 1997 timeseries",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.8286465",
    "publication_date": "2023-08-26",
    "description": "<p>Time series (2Hz) of waves and currents in 5 alongshore arrays from near the shoreline to 7 m water depth at the USACE Field Research Facility, Duck, NC, USA collected between Sep 1 and Oct 31 1997.</p>\n\n<p>The README describes the files with time series of pressure and velocity (2 Hz), the files with the X-Y-Z locations of the sensors, and provides links to the nearly daily bathymetric surveys and the incident (8-m water depth) wave conditions (frequency-directional spectra)</p>",
